      "author_followers": 3520,
      "caption": "Your stomach is ALWAYS bloated.\nMorning? Bloated.\nAfter lunch? Even more bloated.\nBy dinner? You look 6 months pregnant.\n\"I must be eating too much,\" you think.\nNo. It's not how much you're eating.\nHere's what's actually causing it:\n\n1️⃣ YOU'RE EATING TOO FAST\nBreakfast in the car in 5 minutes.\nLunch at your desk while working.\nDinner while watching TV.\nWhen you eat fast, you swallow air.\nAnd you don't chew properly.\nResult: Food sits in your stomach undigested, fermenting, creating gas.\nBloating isn't about WHAT you ate. It's HOW you ate it.\n\n2️⃣ YOUR GUT IS INFLAMED\nYears of:\nProcessed food\nLate night eating\nHigh stress\nZero fiber\nYour gut lining is damaged.\nIt can't digest food properly anymore.\nEverything you eat triggers inflammation = bloating\n\n3️⃣ YOU'RE LACTOSE INTOLERANT (And don't know it)\nThat Milo? Has milk.\nThat teh tarik? Has condensed milk.\nThat kopi? Has evaporated milk.\nMost Asians lose the ability to digest lactose as adults.\nYou're drinking dairy all day and wondering why you're bloated.\n\n4️⃣ YOU'RE NOT DRINKING ENOUGH WATER\nYou think: \"If I'm bloated, I should drink LESS water.\"\nWrong.\nWhen you're dehydrated, your body HOLDS ONTO water (makes you look bloated).\nPlus, without water, your digestion slows down = more bloating.\n\n5️⃣ YOU'RE CONSTIPATED\nIf you're not pooping daily (or it's hard to pass)...\nYou're literally backed up with waste.\nThat \"bloat\"? It's just undigested food sitting in your intestines.\nLow fiber + low water + no movement = constipation = permanent bloat\n\nHOW TO FIX IT:\n✅ Eat slower - 20 minutes minimum per meal, chew properly\n✅ Cut dairy for 2 weeks - See if bloating reduces (it probably will)\n✅ Drink 2L water daily - Helps digestion, reduces water retention\n✅ Add fiber - Vegetables every meal, at least 2 servings\n✅ Move after eating - 10min walk helps digestion\n\nBloating isn't normal.\nIt's your body telling you something is wrong with your digestion.\nFix the root cause. Not just the symptom.\n💬 Comment 'BLOAT' if you're bloated 24/7 and I'll send you my \"Fix Your Bloating\" guide\n\n#MalaysianHealth #MalaysianFitness #WellnessJourney #BodyTransformation #LevelUp ",
